---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayoutEn.astro';
import Hero from '~/components/widgets/Hero.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy - aios.pub',
  description: 'Privacy Policy for AIOS - Learn how we protect your personal information',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <Hero
    tagline="Privacy Policy"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle="We value and protect your personal information security"
    image={null}
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">
        Last Updated: January 1, 2024
      </p>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        AIOS (hereinafter referred to as "we") takes user privacy very seriously. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal information. By using our platform, you agree to this privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information Collection</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, email, company name submitted in contact forms</li>
        <li>Project requirements, technical questions provided during consultations</li>
        <li>Account information when subscribing to services</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Access time, pages visited, time spent</li>
        <li>IP address (anonymized)</li>
        <li>Device identifiers</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Information Use</h2>
      <p>The information we collect is used for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our services</li>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries and requests</li>
        <li>Send service-related notifications and updates</li>
        <li>Analyze user behavior to optimize user experience</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud and ensure platform security</li>
        <li>Comply with legal requirements</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We only share information in the following circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With your explicit consent</li>
        <li>With service providers who help us operate our business (e.g., cloud services, analytics tools)</li>
        <li>When required by law or government authorities</li>
        <li>To protect our rights, property, or safety, or that of our users</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Information Security</h2>
      <p>We take multiple security measures to protect your information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>HTTPS encrypted transmission</li>
        <li>Encrypted data storage</li>
        <li>Access control and security audits</li>
        <li>Regular security assessments and vulnerability fixes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Cookie Usage</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience and analyze website traffic. You can manage cookies through your browser settings, but this may affect certain functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal information</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Delete your personal information</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us at contact@aios.pub.</p>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not directed to children under 14. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you discover that we may have collected information from a child, please contact us immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Updated policies will be published on this page, and significant changes will be notified via email or website announcement.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have privacy-related questions, please contact us through:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: contact@aios.pub</li>
        <li>WeChat Official Account: 架构师部落</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
